WEBVTT

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:10.971
Choose Captions in the side menu.

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:16.891
Click Review captions
for How Plants Make Food.

00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:23.141
Click Play to watch the
video with its captions.

00:00:24.827 --> 00:00:30.025
Click Pause when you want to read a cue.

00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:36.275
Check that Approving is allowed
with warnings shows under the video.

00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:43.463
Click Approve captions.

00:00:43.713 --> 00:00:49.713
Wait until you see Captions approved.
